<title>USA: O'Sullivan repurchases 539,600 shares.</title>
<headline>O'Sullivan repurchases 539,600 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WINCHESTER, Va. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Sullivan Corp said Tuesday that it had bought back a total of 539,600 shares in the open market in accordance with an authorization by the board of directors to repurchase up to 800,000 of the outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
